# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Secrets. .env.local is already covered by *.local, but the rest are not, and
# a leaked signing secret would let anyone cancel someone's safety timer.
# .env.example is committed on purpose — it holds names, never values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vercel

